BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  # The Tale of the Flowing Spring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  In ancient times, the gods created a sacred spring at the mountain's peak. The water possessed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (     a wondrous property: when shared freely, it multiplied threefold before reaching another's ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    cup.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  Two villages dwelt on opposite slopes. The first village controlled the spring's source. Each ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    dawn, they faced a choice: pour water down the mountain or keep it for themselves.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  The elder of the first village was cautious. "Why give away what is ours?" some asked. But the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (     wise woman spoke: "Water shared becomes abundant. Water hoarded turns bitter.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (  When the first village poured generously, the spring's magic transformed their offering. The s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (    econd village received threefold abundance. Grateful, they sent back portions up the mountai) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (    n-fresh bread, ripe fruits, woven cloth.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (  But when fear ruled and the first village withheld, both villages suffered. The spring's magic) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (     only worked through the act of giving. The gods designed it thus: trust creates abundance, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (    but only when met with gratitude and fair return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (  Seasons passed. The villages learned the rhythm-give freely, receive abundantly, return fairly) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    . The spring never dried, and both villages flourished. For they understood: prosperity flow) Tj ET
