BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a barren valley. Each possessed ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        a magical spring that produced five measures of water daily.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      The first village discovered a sacred pool in the valley's heart. When water was poured in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        to this pool, it multiplied threefold before flowing to the other side. Yet the villages) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (         remained isolated, each hoarding their precious water.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      One summer, a wise elder from the first village carried her spring's water to the sacred p) Tj ET
