BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        through a hidden underground channel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      The elder rejoiced-she had given five but received ten in return!) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      Seeing this miracle, the second village began their own offerings. Each village learned th) Tj ET
